## Suitability Report

<!-- image -->

John Sullivan

Date: 14/10/2025

Thomas Redmond DipPFS Cert CII

Independent Financial Adviser

TFAS Wealth Ltd Second Floor St Andrews House 119-121 The Headrow Leeds LS1 5JW

